                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Basically, yoU wiLL SerIously Hate everythIng in This GAME.  One failed easter egg after another, and nothing more than a trial-error-repeat simulator.  For example, you can pray to Putin, and you magically get American dollars to rain down on you as well as some bitcoins.  Then you will probably order a stripper online that costs the exact amount of bitcoins you just got.  After you realize you just ordered a stripper in your game, in real life you realize that you have nothing to live for, so you restart the game and have your character commit suicide for you. \nYa, for now save your money until there are more easter eggs and the price comes down to $0.49 with a coupon you can easily get from crafting steam badges.\n",
